+ StableKey is U64

+ stable-key-seed StableKey = 14695981039346656037

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ mixed StableKey
    - key StableKey
    - word U64

` A stable key is hashed from what a type or an instance is, never from its id, so two runs
` that intern the same rows in different orders give each row the same key.
scrambled /xor/ (scrambled /zrshift/ 32)

.. scrambled = (key /xor/ word) * 11400714819323198485

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do mixed-text StableKey
    - key StableKey
    - text String

. bytes = text as CPointer'Byte
. result = mixed(key, text.size as U64)
for index in 0 .. < text.size
    result = (result /xor/ bytes[index]) * 1099511628211
= result
